Directive_3Player_PassMarker_A=Then, since this is a 3 player game, pass the starting player marker clockwise 1 additional time.
Directive_AgilityDefinition=**Agility** is equal to the VP of your Biology Experiment. _(The ability to dodge attacks.)_
Directive_AllPlayersBidMoney=All players take all their money into their hands. They will then secretly choose any amount of money to place into their right hand to bid.
Directive_BhomeGainsHouseOnHill={bhome} gains the **House on the Hill** tile and places it face-up near their Estate. 
Directive_BhomeVisitsAsTownLocation={bhome} may visit this Location as if it were a TOWN Location for the remainder of the game. No other players may visit this Location.
Directive_BlackBorderMovesMobLeft=Visiting any Location with a black border moves the {icon:angrymob_icon} Marker left.
Directive_BothPlayersBidMoney=Both players take all their money into their hands. They will then secretly choose any amount of money to place into their right hand to bid.
Directive_BricksExpandEstatePlot=Bricks can now be used to expand to new plots in your Estate. When expanding to a new plot, each brick token you spend is worth $1.
Directive_CannotPay_ReturnSelfFragment= (You must choose this option if you cannot pay. Your Self will be returned to the box.)
Directive_CannotPlaceServantsUntilMobReached=You cannot place Servants/Spouse in TOWN until you have **reached or exceeded the** {icon:angrymob_icon} Marker. Caretaker pieces can be placed in TOWN.
