Directive_DamageDefinition=**Damage** is equal to the VP of your Engineering Experiment. _(The strength of your attacks.)_
Directive_DoNotReadBelow=**Do not read the passage below to the other players.**
Directive_ElectionWinnerPaysBid=Only the player who wins the election must pay their bid to the supply. The other returns their money to their Estate.
Directive_EndGeneration_Bare=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation.
Directive_EndGeneration_ReturnAsylumupHouseOnHill=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation. Return any remaining {asylumup} tiles to the box. Return the **House on the Hill** tile to the Scenario box.
Directive_EndGeneration_ReturnStorybookSpace35=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation. Return the Storybook token on space 35 to the supply.
Directive_EndGeneration_ReturnUnusedStorybookTokens=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation. Return any unused {icon:storybooktoken} tokens to the supply.
