Narrative_ChagrinDemocraticProcess=To our chagrin, the choice is left to the democratic process. We are resigned to the results.
Narrative_ContributionsHoldSway=We are happy to see that our contributions to society still hold sway.
Narrative_CuriousBlessing=What a curious blessing!
Narrative_DarkCloakedFiendsPayment=The dark-cloaked fiends took my payment and disappeared into the night. No carriage conveyed them. I witnessed only the sudden flurry of wings and a cauldron of bats against the full moon.
Narrative_DaysLockedAwayLaboratory=I have spent days upon days locked away within my secret laboratory. It is as though my entire existence is singularly focused on the pursuit of scientific excellence. I do not care if it drives me mad! If my contributions can advance Science even by a minute amount it will all be worth it!
Narrative_EmployerNotPleased="Our employer will not be pleased by this decision," the other man hissed, then raised his ebony cloak just below his eyes and made a hasty, yet graceful exit from my Estate with his followers in tow. The insinuative nerve of that individual! Why they would not contact the executor to settle their minor financial quibbles is beyond my understanding!
Narrative_ErrorExclaim=ERROR!
Narrative_FinalDaysOfRespite=My final days of respite were rudely interrupted by a couple of gentlemen with dark overcoats and carmine lapels. They entered my home during supper, pressing past the caretaker and casually voicing their apologies.
Narrative_FineHairsOnPalm=I could distinctly see fine hairs growing from the center of his palm as he talked.
Narrative_ForOneDollarNewServant="**For $1**, you have my word that if I have gained a foothold in the region, I will provide you a **new servant** with each passing decade."
Narrative_ForThreeDollarsDeed=**"For $3**, I will offer you the **deed to my home** for use at your leisure when this Asylum business has concluded."
Narrative_ForTwoDollarsBallChain=**"For $2**, I will guarantee a lucrative investment in labor _(you will immediately gain the Ball & Chain Estate Upgrade)_."
Narrative_HideousHexSacrificeCousin=With a hideous hex upon the village, at the end of the second round, the cousins will need to sacrifice one of their number. Choosing the right cousin will be worth VP, but whoever is chosen will **die**.
Narrative_LandChangedHuntAbandoned=With the land changed, the hunt is abandoned forever.
Narrative_LateOneEvening_Fragment= late one evening. I offered my sincere thanks and left swiftly to ponder this small revelation.
Narrative_LeanedForwardCoarseWhisper=He leaned forward, speaking with a coarse whisper and I could smell a rankness in his breath.
Narrative_LeaveYourMark=Be sure to leave your mark on the world.
Narrative_LustForFame=My lust for fame knows no boundaries. Whether fulfilled through ethical means or the mark of infamy, I was born with a yearning to be known both far and wide for my scientific exploits. These narcissistic thoughts plague my waking hours and infect my dreams!
Narrative_ManSmiledSecondTime=The man smiled once again. "Of course, let us try a second time."
Narrative_MausoleumSpouseSolution=Whether for love or purpose - I know not which drove my decision - I broke into the mausoleum housing my spouse and applied the solution to their skeletal features. _Following the exact recipe for the formulae proved difficult, but I was able to make due with local alternatives._
Narrative_MenPleasedGenerousDecision=The men were pleased with my generous decision and pledged to never return again. Though they expressed themselves firmly, I was impressed to see them turn and gracefully exit without leaving a single speck of dust upon the carpeted entryway.
Narrative_NewspaperRegretsNoRomaniCaravan={newspaper} regrets to report that another season has gone by in {townname} without the bright colors and inviting pageantry of the Romani caravans. The town has instead decided to hold its own market event in hopes of rewarding those who have been waiting patiently in anticipation.
Narrative_NotImpressedByOffer=I was admittedly not impressed by the offer, but perhaps this was the opening of negotiations.
Narrative_OminousNoteDebtRepaid=An ominous note appeared at my bedside table just the other day. It was written in precise calligraphy on thick pearl paper pressed with an intricate filigree at the edges. "The debt has been repaid," it stated in bright red ink. That very same morning, I felt a dull ache and subsequently discovered two blemishes upon my neck, like mosquito bites, one above the other spaced about five centimeters apart.
Narrative_PaleIndividualsCoalBlackSuits=I do not know how they got past my defenses, but these pale individuals dressed in angular, coal-black suits came to my door seeking payment of an old debt. When my caretaker forbade them entry, they merely separated the double-door from its hinges without the use of weapons. Even now they skulk about, calling me by name and hissing like an alleycat protecting its meal.
Narrative_PhysicalCharmsFinancialPersuasion_Fragment=Using both my physical charms and gentle financial persuasion, I was able to pry some intriguing information from an individual, who stated that they personally witnessed 
Narrative_PleasureInExperimentation=I find pleasure in the simple act of experimentation. Every tested hypothesis is a delectable morsel to be savored. And is it not my obligation - my right - to share this sense of wonder with the world? The wretches deserve to be entertained - for what is life without spectacle and indulgence?
Narrative_PoxOnMyFamily=A pox on my family! They have doomed me to oblivion just as victory was within my grasp!
Narrative_RefusalMeansDeath=My refusal will most certainly mean my death. I can only hope my will is carried out by those who outlive me.
Narrative_RegisteredCitizenBackgroundCheck=As a registered citizen within the district, you must undergo a strict government background check and perform civic duty obligations.
Narrative_SurroundedBySimpleMindedFilth=I am surrounded by simple-minded human filth. How dare they look at such an affluent individual with judgement in their eyes? How dare they interfere with an aristocrat's greatest, most valuable work? Oh, they will PAY for their insolence!
Narrative_TensionsRiseAngryMob=As tensions rise and accusations increase in their frequency, the angry mob will need to be appeased.
Narrative_ThirstForKnowledge=My thirst for knowledge is unquenchable. Each evening I search through ancient tomes and scholarly texts, scouring every printed word and mathematical formula as if it were the last I will ever read.
Narrative_VacationHomeSuspicion=It is not surprising that they would purchase a vacation home. But a retreat that is only a dozen miles ride away? 
Narrative_WelcomeToMyFathersWork_Fragment=Welcome to My Father's Work,
Narrative_WillNotSufferFools=I will not suffer fools. It is just as important for a peasant or a king to know their place in the presence of my genius. I will show them **all** how to pay homage to their betters. Soon there will be no way to ignore my inspirational presence and I will command respect!
Narrative_WriteByCandlelightSpandrel=I write this note by candlelight as I have locked myself within the spandrel under the first floor stairs.
