Reward_MostOccultExperiments_CabinetOfCuriosities=At the End of the Generation, the player with the most completed **Occult** Experiments gains the **Cabinet of Curiosities** Vanity Estate Upgrade. 
Reward_SecondMostBricks=The player who has the second-most bricks will also receive this Upgrade.
Reward_SecondMostExperiments_HasVariant=The player who has the second-most Experiments will also receive this Upgrade.
Reward_SecondMostExperiments_WithVariant=The player with the second-most Experiments will also receive this Upgrade.
