Creature_012=**The Asylum**
Creature_013=The town has resolved to provide safety for its citizens, but not repeat the mistakes of the past. The ground is already broken for the construction of the new Asylum. At the end of this round, it will be built.

# passages/00013-ForeignIntro.mws.yaml
ForeignIntro_001=Hexes and Hysteria
ForeignIntro_003=**Letter from** **{randomname} -** _April, 1863. Romania._
ForeignIntro_004=I hope you will forgive the direct manner in which this letter is received. Due to recent events, I no longer entrust my correspondence to postal carriers and prefer to hire discrete private couriers. This message is meant for your eyes only and I will not allow those who so blatantly scheme against me an opportunity to uncover my motives!
ForeignIntro_005=This town has gone mad.
ForeignIntro_006=I have only just been situated these past few months with my spouse and close servants, and scarcely familiarized myself with the thatched-roofs and bucolic scenery, yet already I have seen the fires blaze at night, the screams of the damned, and the gibbet creaking under the weight of swinging bodies. The mob comes with torches in the evening and rips the accused from their residences. It appears that my parent's warnings proved true. The occult hysteria that they endured has returned in earnest! I fear that I may be next!
ForeignIntro_007=Even my own cousins have begun to eye me like mongrel dogs, yearning for scraps. In their jealous mania, they wish to uncover my secrets and claim them for their own. I can see how they desire to place the blame upon me; to distract me from completing my family's important scientific work! It would break my heart to see ill come to them, yet if they continue in their provocations, I will not hesitate to unleash the fires of hell upon them.
ForeignIntro_008=But I am secure in my ambitions. I have uncovered my true purpose. I will not succumb to fear. My secret work consumes my waking hours and I will stop at nothing to see it come to fruition!
ForeignIntro_010=Butcher's Apprentice
ForeignIntro_011=Blacksmith's Apprentice
ForeignIntro_018=Farmer's Apprentice

# passages/00014-CreatureIntro.mws.yaml
CreatureIntro_001=Towards Civility
CreatureIntro_002=**Letter from** **{randomname} -** _2 March 1863. Romania._
CreatureIntro_003=As mariners are wont to say; there is always a lull before the storm. As I am wont to say; a lowering of barometric pressure generally occurs before the storm. And this idiom certainly applies to the horror of my current situation.
CreatureIntro_004=My family's manor is set on a small precipice, its imposing iron gate emerging from the forest like the mouth of an otherworldly beast. You have no doubt seen the daguerreotype, so I will not delve further into detail. I remembered the daunting architecture from my youth, and returning to claim my inheritance left me feeling trepidatious.
CreatureIntro_005=Whatever the cause, it appears the delirium of the past has ebbed and conversations about the darker history of the town are now relegated to whispers in private. The consensus is that justice has been served and modern living has prevailed over the old ways. In fact, there are many who deny that the events occurred at all.
CreatureIntro_006=The underlying symptoms of mass hysteria have channeled themselves into other menial and unproductive modes of thinking. I am of the opinion that they overcompensate for the shames of their past. While the ground has just been broken, the district has invested in the most modern alienist philosophies — absurd and untested as those theories are — and a new Asylum is being constructed to focus on the rehabilitation of the mind.
CreatureIntro_007=So, like a wolf licking its wounds, the town has returned to a relative peace. And for a moment, it seemed that the calm would provide a welcome atmosphere to return to my labors.
CreatureIntro_008=That is, until the Creature appeared in my window one night, it's bulky frame wet with rain.
CreatureIntro_012=Asylum Share
CreatureIntro_013=Puppy
CreatureIntro_014=Bride
CreatureIntro_015=Puppy and Bride

# passages/00015-S4Foreign1.mws.yaml
S4Foreign1_001=Construction Matters
S4Foreign1_006=The mayor has announced the construction of a new monument in {townname}. While details of its construction remain scarce, public pressure and anonymous donations have been the deciding factor in the architectural direction the structure has taken.
S4Foreign1_007=**Bricks**
