# passages/00038-4Notes.mws.yaml
_4Notes_001=TODO:
_4Notes_002=Double-check MANIA links (make sure nothing is dead)
_4Notes_003=Double-check TITLE at TOP > Journal name second
_4Notes_004=Intro & Edit Event
_4Notes_010=1/4 - added Essential Salts 3rd leg intro and resolution- need to hook up and write. (note to add possibly +occult)
_4Notes_011=Find and set correct page turn number for dead person in GEN 1.
_4Notes_012=Gotta replace the Lib/Cons with the Asylum track. Could be related. Could have an influence on you.
_4Notes_013=Is rehabilitation a possibility? Can a damaged mind be repaired?
_4Notes_014=Maybe the county wants to know if it's possible. How would they go about making this? Maybe the choice of how to use the Asylum influences how it goes.
_4Notes_015=Maybe the players are offered a secret opportunity to pledge support? They can pick a scientific discipline to specialize in.
_4Notes_016=**Nellie Bly - Expose about Blackwell's Island - Ten Days in a Mad-House**
_4Notes_017=Nurses drugged inmates with “so much morphine and chloral that the patients are made crazy,” Bly reported. “The attendants seemed to find amusement and pleasure in exciting the violent patients to do their worst,” she wrote.
_4Notes_018=The horrid condition of the food in the mess hall was her first dose of deprivation. Tea “tasted as if it had been made in copper,” she writes. Bread was spread with rancid butter. When she got a plain piece it was hard with a “dirty black color. . . . I found a spider in my slice so I did not eat it.” The oatmeal and molasses served at the meal was “wretched.” The next day she was served soup with one cold boiled potato and a chunk of beef, “which on investigation, proved to be slightly spoiled.”
_4Notes_019=JAIL - Haunted by the Ghosts of the Asylum -
_4Notes_020=Tales of the treatment of the inmates began to filter through the close-knit community. The Asylum became overcrowded and the county repurposed the facility into a Jail.
_4Notes_021=Maybe Witch candidate visits a random player and is super nice to them.
_4Notes_022=Creature demands too expensive right now, or not worth enough.
_4Notes_023=Need personal agenda aspects. More in general. Choices for individuals.
_4Notes_024=TOKEN for any bonuses that the Storybook provides for doing a certain action as a reminder.
_4Notes_025=Consider the third option. Also should it be called "Park"? Is there a better place to collect chemicals? General Store.
_4Notes_026=Vote to kill the General Store Owner.
_4Notes_027=Personal Get Out of Jail Free card for the Smugglers later
_4Notes_028=Dog and Bride and (insert here) for 5 players
_4Notes_029=Could get multiple Investor tokens for something
_4Notes_030=WALL -
_4Notes_031=Chance meetings: Give some clue as to what to do when visited by Cons or Lib in 2nd round.
_4Notes_032=Sanity at more than 3 cards.
_4Notes_033=BARventures:
_4Notes_034=Regain 2 Sanity.
_4Notes_035=Adventure makes an area of the board creepy to visit for you. Gives a bonus as well.
_4Notes_036=Round 2 Philosophical Debate Event -
_4Notes_037=God vs. Science. Humors vs. New Theories.
_4Notes_038=? Choose to mock or affirm.

