# passages/00042-ThisTenseGood.mws.yaml
ThisTenseGood_003=Peace. The townsfolk use this word so flippantly, it has become tawdry. Can there truly be peace without struggle? What is peace for all when I am not at peace myself?
ThisTenseGood_004=They have come to an agreement. Peace. Our family's actions, they deemed, were not the cause of their ills. They see how we struggled over the years for them and now they express their thanks. The Memorial is converted to an institute of higher learning in honor of the embrace of modern values.
ThisTenseGood_005=I am glad that they have pushed past their ignorance, but it is too little too late in my opinion.
ThisTenseGood_007=Remove the {icon:angrymob_icon} Marker from the {icon:creepy_icon} Track.

# passages/00043-Isolation2.mws.yaml
