# passages/00046-CreatureDemands.mws.yaml
CreatureDemands_001=The Creature's Demands
CreatureDemands_003=To my surprise, the hideous monster could speak, his jaw supported by a crudely stitched black thread which exposed the inner muscle when it moved. In deep, guttural tones, he conveyed his hatred for my grandfather, who had created him and abandoned him, helpless in the wild. "I was forcefully orphaned. Left to fend for myself while his sons and daughters existed in luxury," he groaned.
CreatureDemands_004=They say the sins of the father are passed on to the children, but rarely does this obligation skip a full generation. "You owe me a great debt, and I am here to demand payment," he stated firmly, and obstructed my escape until he could finish his tale. I was awestruck by his chilling words and the revelation that our family's dark secrets were indeed a reality.
CreatureDemands_005=Cursed into existence despite his decaying form, my grandfather's experiment demanded to live out his days with a faithful companion, another being who can understand the torture of existence. That it was my family's duty to atone for these sins and create it for him!
CreatureDemands_006=With a final turn, his grotesque figure framed in moonlight, he vowed that if we did not, he would exact a terrible vengeance upon our houses, so that we may know first-hand what torment he has endured!

