S4Asylum3_001=Asylum Resolution
S4Asylum3_002=The Institution thanked us for our consideration. I was certain that the consequences of our decision would not be resolved until a later date.
S4Asylum3_003=**How many players chose to buy an Asylum Estate Upgrade?**
S4Asylum3_004=None.
S4Asylum3_005=1.
S4Asylum3_006=2.
S4Asylum3_007=3.
S4Asylum3_008=4.
S4Asylum3_009=5.

# passages/00160-Payment1A.mws.yaml
Payment1A_005=One of them began to speak with a sinister accent of which I was unfamiliar. His exaggerated widow's peak and slick, black hair remained perfect throughout our discourse. "Our lord wanted us to express our gratitude for your pledged contribution. Before you croak, we wanted to see if you have the ${Acont} you owe him."

