ProperLetterHeading_007=Unless I figure out an alternative, the (cont.) notes, will just have to be **Journal Entry - (cont.)** or **Journal Entry - {nameA} (cont.)** with name being instead the temp code needed. This will have to be copy-pasted in some situations to alter it.
