# passages/00313-TenseGoodEvent1.mws.yaml
TenseGoodEvent1_001=However, their tolerance does bring with it some benefits, I'm sure. The ability to exercise my glorious science without constraints is encouraging.
TenseGoodEvent1_002=In addition to this lax attitude, the townsfolk state that when I am stretched to my limits, I will be offered a bit of solace in the nearby hills. There is a small intersection on the outskirts of town, and a messenger will meet me there. Though I haven't the faintest what good it will do.
TenseGoodEvent1_003=Put a {icon:storybooktoken} **token** on space {crossroads} of the {icon:creepy_icon} Track.

# passages/00314-TenseEventBad2b.mws.yaml
TenseEventBad2b_001=Conspiracy to Purloin
TenseEventBad2b_002=**YAY:** Vote to steal **2 Resources** from the village. _Resources are any type of Ingredient, Knowledge, or money._ The consequence of this action is that any player who does not **Deepen** their Obsession **loses {obsvp}VP**.
TenseEventBad2b_003=**NAY:** Vote to acquire nothing and retain ethical distance.
TenseEventBad2b_004=Then, tally the vote count _(ties are broken by the one who went last this round)._

# passages/00315-JunkPalaceMeet.mws.yaml
JunkPalaceMeet_001=A Plan Revealed
JunkPalaceMeet_002=**Carefully pick up the Storybook device and hand it to {tempname}. Do not allow any other players to see the screen.**
JunkPalaceMeet_003=I was ushered into a large concrete area where previously inmates would have received time for exercise. {warden} had prepared a hideous outdoor feast on a long table fashioned with a stained tablecloth and chairs cobbled together from copper scraps and animal hides. Piles of indeterminate cuts of meat were arranged on large metal platters and charred to varying degrees.
JunkPalaceMeet_004=The misfit wasteland followers laughed from behind grinning teeth adorned with shreds of meat stuck between the gaps.
JunkPalaceMeet_005=The table creaked as the motley crew surrounding it banged their gloved fists on the surface. I observed as what appeared to be an eyeball, caramelized with grill marks, fell to the floor and rolled away.
JunkPalaceMeet_006="It is good that you dine with me today, for I wish you to know the fate I have in store for you." {_rnd_JunkPalaceMeet_1}
JunkPalaceMeet_007=**The penalty for not reaching the end of the {icon:creepy_icon} track:**
JunkPalaceMeet_008="It is good that you dine with me today, for I wish you to know the fate I have in store for you." {_rnd_JunkPalaceMeet_0}
JunkPalaceMeet_009=**The penalty for not reaching the end of the {icon:creepy_icon} Track:**

