# passages/00333-LiberalTaxes1.mws.yaml
LiberalTaxes1_001=Choose
LiberalTaxes1_002=In turn order, **for every 2 Upgrades in their Estate, each player may pay $1** to the supply to resolve their estate taxes _(this amount must be paid in full)_ **OR** they may refuse to pay this amount and accept the standard terms of seizure of goods or trade.
LiberalTaxes1_003=Once all players have paid or refused, 
LiberalTaxes1_004=click here to continue...

# passages/00334-LiberalEvent1.mws.yaml
LiberalEvent1_001=VOTE
LiberalEvent1_002=Each player retrieves their Voting token, places it into their fist, and secretly determines a side to reveal. All players then reveal their vote and tally the winner. _(Ties are broken by the player who was last in turn order the previous round)._
LiberalEvent1_003=**YAY** - A vote for **YAY** is a vote to increase taxes. **This decision will cause all players to spend $1.**
LiberalEvent1_004=**NAY** - A vote for **NAY** is a vote for stricter citizenship guidelines and reduced funding for non-essential social programs. **This decision will cause the {asylumup} program to be shut down (returned to the Scenario box).**

# passages/00335-LiberalEvent1a.mws.yaml
LiberalEvent1a_001=**Choose which way the vote went:**
LiberalEvent1a_002=Voted to Increase Taxes. (YAY)
LiberalEvent1a_004=Voted to be Nationalist. (NAY)

# passages/00336-EssentialSalts1.mws.yaml
EssentialSalts1_001=The Choice
EssentialSalts1_002=**In turn order, all players may:**
EssentialSalts1_003=**Pay $1** or **Discard a** {icon:chemical_icon} **ingredient** to attempt to **regain their Spouse**.
EssentialSalts1_004=_While the experiment may not return our handsome spouse to the vigor of their original form, they_ **will at least be able to help out around the Estate.** _However, there will be_ **Creepy** _consequences of varying degrees._
EssentialSalts1_005=After all players have had an opportunity, please choose the appropriate option below.
EssentialSalts1_006=**Your Choice:**
EssentialSalts1_007=If at least one player chooses to resurrect their spouse, 
EssentialSalts1_008=click here to witness the results...
EssentialSalts1_009=If all players refuse, 

# passages/00337-EssentialSaltsNo.mws.yaml
EssentialSaltsNo_001=The Risk is Too Great
EssentialSaltsNo_002=Today I placed a single lily onto the grave of my lost love. Though my heart was heavy with sorrow, my family's folly generations ago had taught me a valuable lesson.
EssentialSaltsNo_003=Life is meant to be extinguished. It blooms but for a moment so vividly against the grayness of the world.
EssentialSaltsNo_004=You were cut short at the stem, but this is nothing to grieve. I will remember your brilliance forever. Rest in peace, my love.
EssentialSaltsNo_005=All players **Lose 1** {icon:creepy_icon} and **gain 1** {icon:chemical_icon}.

# passages/00338-LiberalEvent2a.mws.yaml
LiberalEvent2a_001=BRIBE
LiberalEvent2a_002=All players take all their coins into one hand. Place as many coins as you are willing to offer towards the bribe and place them into your other hand, being sure to keep all coins secret. When you have decided how many coins to contribute, extend this hand to the center of the table in a closed fist.
LiberalEvent2a_003=Once all players have chosen, reveal the coins in your fists. Count up all coins offered. **If you have collectively met or exceeded{bribed}, the bribe succeeds** and all players pay their money to the supply. If the bribe fails, no money is spent.
LiberalEvent2a_004=Click here to resolve the bribe...

