PrivateCreepPenalty_001=Penalty for Defiance
PrivateCreepPenalty_002={warden} has enacted a penalty for all players who did not reach the end of the {icon:creepy_icon} Track.
PrivateCreepPenalty_003=**{nameA}** must suffer the penalty below.
