PrivateCreepPenalty_005=**{nameC}** must suffer the penalty below.
PrivateCreepPenalty_006=**{nameD}** must suffer the penalty below.
PrivateCreepPenalty_007=**{nameE}** must suffer the penalty below.
PrivateCreepPenalty_008=**Any player who did NOT reach the end of the {icon:creepy_icon} Track**

# passages/00340-TenseEventBad2Yes.mws.yaml
TenseEventBad2Yes_001=Goods Procured
TenseEventBad2Yes_002=There is nothing more paramount than personal conviction! These peons forced my hand, but it was I who triumphed under cover of darkness and retrieved the goods I most certainly deserved. There will be consequences if my scientific aspirations do not produce results that dazzle all of Transylvania.
TenseEventBad2Yes_003=But, I know that I will not fail. Science never fails!
TenseEventBad2Yes_004=All players may now **gain 2 Resources of their choice** from the supply. 
TenseEventBad2Yes_005=The player who won the bid gains 1 additional Resource.
TenseEventBad2Yes_006=Any player who voted **NAY** loses **2** {icon:insanity_icon} _(moves their token 2 spaces to the left)_ if possible.

# passages/00341-TenseEventBad2No.mws.yaml
TenseEventBad2No_001=Ethics Prevail
TenseEventBad2No_002=I am ill. Is this to be my fate - bound and restricted forever by the capricious whims of an angry mob? My cousins could not stomach the pressure; they faltered when faced with the minutest of difficulties. They force me to remain at home, listless, watching helplessly as caravans enter and exit {townname} almost daily.
TenseEventBad2No_003=Damn my unconquerable desire to please those around me! I curse this foul heart of mine that finds within it kindness for my enemies!
TenseEventBad2No_004=Move the **Angry Mob** token {icon:angrymob_icon} {players+1} spaces to the right.
TenseEventBad2No_005=Any player who voted **YAY** gains **1 Knowledge cube** of their choice.

