TenseEventBad2Res_002=Count up all votes by all players. _(Ties are broken by the one who went last this round)._
TenseEventBad2Res_003=**Choose the result of the vote:**
TenseEventBad2Res_004=We voted to steal. (YAY)
TenseEventBad2Res_005=We voted against. (NAY)

