# passages/00345-2PTenseEvent1.mws.yaml
_2PTenseEvent1_002=The players are bidding for the right to choose whether to steal Resources or to abstain. **The player who wins the bid will:**
_2PTenseEvent1_003=**Choose to Steal Resources** - Both players will **gain 2 Resources**. The winning player will gain 1 additional Resource. _Resources are any type of Ingredient, Knowledge, or money._ The consequence of this action is that any player who does not **Deepen** their Obsession **loses {obsvp} VP**.
_2PTenseEvent1_004=**Vote to acquire nothing and retain ethical distance.**

# passages/00346-2PTenseEvent2.mws.yaml
_2PTenseEvent2_002=I choose to steal resources.
_2PTenseEvent2_003=I choose to remain ethical and do nothing.

# passages/00347-2PLiberalEvent.mws.yaml
_2PLiberalEvent_001=Players are bidding for the right to choose the abysmal new direction of the town. **The player who wins the bid will choose between:**
_2PLiberalEvent_002=**Increased Taxes** - This decision will cause all players to spend $1.
_2PLiberalEvent_003=**Stricter Citizenship and Funding Cuts** - This decision will cause the {asylumup} program to be shut down _(returned to the Scenario box)_.

# passages/00348-2PLiberalEvent1.mws.yaml
_2PLiberalEvent1_001=I choose to raise taxes.
