AsylumQuestion9_004=This will never happen.
AsylumQuestion9_005=Kill them and replace them with a clone.

# passages/00378-AsylumTestResults.mws.yaml
AsylumTestResults_001=an abnormally low result which could be symptomatic of disease in the endocrine and nervous system.
AsylumTestResults_002=a reasonably low result which is usually accompanied by low blood pressure and general malaise.
AsylumTestResults_003=no statistically significant variation.
AsylumTestResults_004=a slightly higher result which could be dietary in nature.
AsylumTestResults_005=an abnormally high percentage of carbon dioxide production sometimes associated with agitated and aggressive behavior.
AsylumTestResults_006=minor signs of malnutrition, dehydration, and ruddy complexion, usually associated with stressful events.
AsylumTestResults_007=a healthy individual within the typical ranges considered as normal.
AsylumTestResults_008=nothing particularly concerning or outside of the norm aside from several chemical burn marks across the forearms.
AsylumTestResults_009=signs of obesity due to a life of sedentary indulgence common amongst the upper-middle class.
AsylumTestResults_010=After completion of a full mental evaluation, a basal metabolism test was conducted, indicating {_rnd_AsylumTestResults_0} This was accompanied by a standard physical examination which revealed {_rnd_AsylumTestResults_1}
AsylumTestResults_011=Patient {question} has been admitted to the Asylum for permanent residency. It is my belief that even temporary release of an individual with such strong psychotic tendencies would be a disservice to mankind. But for the grace of god, I see no possible end to this mental affliction. The only conscionable course of action is to refuse them the ability to enact their horrible schemes. 
AsylumTestResults_012=It is of my informed opinion that patient {question} should receive continued evaluation over the coming years. This can be achieved by infrequent visitations by a physician. Full release dependent upon **payment of $1**.
AsylumTestResults_013=Patient {question} has been admitted for static electro-therapy and is progressing towards full release in the coming weeks. Prescribed laudanum and phosphates for nerves. Recommend bed rest and mild sedation. Patient severely disputes this prescriptive inaction.
AsylumTestResults_014=I have offered training to a close associate of patient {question}, in order to assist with specified home care upon release. Subject's behavior and mental state is erratic enough to warrant vigilant supervision. While this caretaker's visage suggests that they may also benefit from psychoanalysis, I am satisfied by their dedication and promise to provide the utmost care to {question}.
AsylumTestResults_015=After several aggressive outbursts while confined, patient {question} has been restrained during the evenings to prevent possible self-harm. I have consulted with members of the Vienna Psychoanalytic Society and their analysis implies deep-seated sexual repression manifesting in dissociative behavior. We are proceeding with an operation to sterilize the patient. This should have the combined effect of reducing a drive towards the destruction of self and others.
AsylumTestResults_016=It appears patient {question} has no physical or noticeable mental deficiencies, though their demeanor is forceful at times. Ailment is assumed to be psychological in nature, possibly brought about by recent stresses. I have recommended heroin for treatment, as it is readily available, non-addictive, and reasonably priced. Perhaps the relaxing effects will also provide respite.
AsylumTestResults_017=If you have not placed your Self piece this round, immediately take an action by placing your Self piece and then place your Self piece into Lost. _If you have already completed an action this round, simply place your Self piece into Lost._
AsylumTestResults_018=Lose 4 VP.
AsylumTestResults_019=Then, **remove your** {icon:creepy_icon} **marker** from the Angry Mob track. {icon:creepy_icon} actions **do not** cause you to move on the Creepy track for the remainder of the game.
AsylumTestResults_020=Pay **$1 to the supply** or lose 3VP.
AsylumTestResults_021=Gain a **Maladjustment** card and place it face-up near your Estate. This card goes into effect immediately.
AsylumTestResults_022=Immediately place one of your **Caretaker** pieces into Lost. If this piece has already performed an action this round, **lose 2VP**.
AsylumTestResults_023=Gain 2 {icon:insanity_icon}.

